{% macro depth_guide(depth) -%}
{% if depth == "overview" -%}
Overview: the big picture. Plain language and intuition first, minimal notation, few formulas. Focus on what each idea is, why it matters and how the pieces fit together.
{%- elif depth == "rigorous" -%}
Rigorous: precise and thorough. Formal definitions, standard notation, derivations or proofs where the subject has them, edge cases, and exercises that require real reasoning.
{%- else -%}
Practitioner: applied understanding. Concrete techniques, realistic examples, code or worked calculations where the subject has them, good practice and common pitfalls.
{%- endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro style_guide(style) -%}
{% if style == "visual" -%}
Visual learner: draw it. Use a Mermaid diagram wherever structure, flow, sequence or relationships can be drawn (most sections should have at least one), use tables for comparisons, and describe ideas spatially.
{%- elif style == "hands_on" -%}
Hands-on learner: learns by doing. Lead with concrete examples, include runnable code or step-by-step calculations, and give them something to practise.
{%- elif style == "intuition" -%}
Intuition-first learner: open with an analogy or a short story that makes the idea feel natural, build understanding informally, then make it precise.
{%- else -%}
Reader: prefers clear, well-structured prose with precise definitions and careful step-by-step explanations.
{%- endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro learner_profile(profile) -%}
{% if profile -%}
Level: {{ profile.level }}. {{ profile.summary }}
{% if profile.strengths %}Already comfortable with: {{ profile.strengths | join(", ") }}.
{% endif %}{% if profile.gaps %}Needs careful building up: {{ profile.gaps | join(", ") }}.{% endif %}
{%- else -%}
No diagnostic information; assume a motivated beginner.
{%- endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro outline_text(modules, current_section_id=None) -%}
{% for module in modules %}
Module {{ loop.index }}: {{ module.title }}
{% for section in module.sections %}
  {{ loop.index }}. {{ section.title }}{% if section.summary %}: {{ section.summary }}{% endif %}{% if current_section_id and section.id == current_section_id %}  <- the section to write now{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{%- endmacro %}
